  << Read-only inspection functions registered in revision 1.1 (operation IDs
     12..24). All are read-only or pure computation, so they bind under the
     same host-read capability as the original twelve. State-changing families
     (file mutation, sockets, timers, process control) are intentionally NOT
     registered here; see SLOsSupportCatalog.getStateChangingPlannedFunctions. >>
